# Velero safety

## Read-only default

List backups, schedules, restores, BSL, and status summaries are fine when
Velero work is authorized. Do **not**:

- create a restore
- delete a backup or schedule
- change BSL credentials

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object.

## Restore risk

Before restore: state target cluster/namespace impact and that restore can
overwrite live objects. Prefer inventory evidence (backup phase=Completed)
first. Irreversible restore → scope grill when ambiguous
(`global-execute-first`).
